    {
      "refdes": "U1",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "LM7805",
      "pos": [
        30,
        -4
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "TO-220-3",
      "custom": {
        "name": "LM7805",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "IN",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "OUT",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "LM7805",
          "text": ".subckt LM7805 in gnd out\n* line regulation through a slow path (the data sheet's DC figure) and the ripple from the input (flat, the ripple rejection)\nElf lfa gnd in gnd 1\nRlf lfa lf 1.59Meg\nClf lf gnd 100n\n* output noise (taken as flat over the data sheet's band): a 1 k resistor's noise, scaled\nRnz nz gnd 1k\nBtgt t0 gnd V=5+-3.07946e-05*(V(lf,gnd)-10)+7.07946e-05*(V(in,gnd)-10)\nEn tgt t0 nz gnd 38.8375\n* the ceiling the input leaves (the dropout)\nBdo ind gnd V=V(in,gnd)-1.6-0.398693*I(Vs)\n* the target, no higher than the dropout's ceiling\nEx1 xh1 gnd tgt ind 1000\nD1 xh1 yh1 DREG\nRy1 yh1 gnd 1k\nEy1 y1 gnd yh1 gnd 0.001\nEc1 c1 gnd tgt y1 1\n* the current limit: the current the target asks for (amps as volts), no more than the limit\nBu u gnd V=(V(c1,gnd)-V(out,gnd))/0.00130653\nBlim cl gnd V=limit(2.2+-0.064*(V(in,gnd)-V(out,gnd)-10),0.6,2.2)\nEx2 xh2 gnd u cl 1000\nD2 xh2 yh2 DREG\nRy2 yh2 gnd 1k\nEy2 y2 gnd yh2 gnd 0.001\nEc2 uc gnd u y2 1\nBc2 c2 gnd V=V(out,gnd)+0.00130653*V(uc,gnd)\n* output through the load regulation's resistance; the output current comes from the input (both ways, as the earlier\n* bundled models did: a dead or reversed input then leaves the output near 0 V)\nEo o gnd c2 gnd 1\nVs o os DC 0\nRo os out 0.00130653\nBin in gnd I=I(Vs)\n* ground (quiescent) current: flat above a few volts, like a resistor near 0 V\nBq in gnd I=0.0032*tanh(V(in,gnd)/2)\n.model DREG D(IS=1e-12 N=1)\n.ends LM7805",
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3"
          ],
          "params": {
            "dropout": 2.0,
            "vout": 5.0
          },
          "limits": [
            "出力電圧、ドロップアウト (入力が低いと出力が下がる)、出力抵抗、負荷電流が入力電流になることを再現するマクロモデルです。",
            "扱わないもの: リップル除去、負荷や入力が急に変わったときの応答、静止電流、過電流保護、熱による制限。",
            "モデルには内部の応答がないので、入力・出力のコンデンサを付けたときの安定性 (発振しないか) は確かめられません。データシートの推奨回路に従ってください。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 35.0,
          "i_max": 1.5,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "出力電圧",
              "value": "5V ±4%"
            },
            {
              "name": "ドロップアウト電圧",
              "value": "2V (代表)",
              "condition": "IO = 1A"
            },
            {
              "name": "熱抵抗 (接合部-周囲)",
              "value": "50℃/W",
              "condition": "TO-220"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
